{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/519111-recruiting-mistwatch-werewolf-the-apocalypse","id":519111,"title":"[Recruiting] Mistwatch -Werewolf: The Apocalypse","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-19T01:48:58-07:00","id":519111,"title":"[Recruiting] Mistwatch -Werewolf: The Apocalypse","content":"Hi all! I'm looking for TWO more players for a pbp taking place on this very forum!<br /> Things you can play: Any of the thirteen Garou tribes presented in the W20 corebook.<br /> Things you can't play: Fera, Black Spiral Dancers, abominations anything that isn't one of the thirteen Garou tribes presented in the W20 corebook.<br /> All auspices welcome.<br /> The setting for the chronicle is detailed at the google doc link posted below. No completed characters sheets please. Just give me a concept for now, and we'll go from there.<br /> <br /> Many thanks, Gaia bless, etc. etc.<br /> <br /> Google doc:<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1J1n7E8QZg4jrqh6jZRNRej_K30YUZfceQpVcXp4o8vA/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...cXp4o8vA/edit#</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3869,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","user":"Al-Haleem","date":". 05-24-2015, 01:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T19:14:05-07:00","id":523841,"title":"","content":"Been a tad busy, but I'll get you Gayle, the Uktena Ahroun. I'll be posting her concept here to rip apart. I'll start by saying she'll be quirky, but hopefully unmanageable. As I have to insert some little comedy, she's one of those &quot;Fraction-Americans&quot; that will say &quot;I'm half-Scotch-Irish, 1/16 German, 1/16 Polish, 1/4 Comanche&quot;. And somehow that 1/4th was enough to attract the Uktena...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T19:29:10-07:00","id":524983,"title":"","content":"Don't worry, you already count as recruited Bashir. Post all Gayle-related stuff in this thread: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/519097-ooc-mistwatch-werewolf-the-apocalypse\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...the-apocalypse</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-24T01:48:50-07:00","id":526461,"title":"","content":"I would be interested.<br /> <br /> Not sure whether Star Gazer (due to Ethnicity) of Glass Walker (Due to Interest/History) would fit best.<br /> <br /> Freddy Kaalim, Ahroun. Half-Korean, Half-Filipino born in Daly City. Father left him as an infant, raised by an abusive mother. Joined a gang before he was a teen, minor arrests for fights and drug possession. Changed not too long ago, has tried to quit the Life, but still a little thug.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1840,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1840-akashicmonk","user":"akashicmonk","date":".  Entered character stuff. 05-24-2015, 05:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1840-akashicmonk","name":"akashicmonk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1840_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-24T02:52:00-07:00","id":526504,"title":"","content":"Alrighty. Here's a few questions: Does Freddy still belong to a gang? If so, what's the name and it's influence in San Francisco? (Feel free to make this stuff up) As the characters will start off at Mistwatch Sept, what would have drawn Freddy there? Does Freddy have a mentor and/or some whose advice he respects? As for tribe, a Stargazer Ahroun's always fun, although the tribe isn't well represented in the Bay. Glass Walkers have a lot more influence, but will likely want to drag Freddy into their schemes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-24T03:37:12-07:00","id":526515,"title":"","content":"I was originally thinking Star Gazer, in which case perhaps Thunder Tiger (possible mentor?) found him after his First Change and brought him in to teach him inner peace.<br /> <br /> Gangs are a &quot;4 Life&quot; thing. He is trying to get out of it without killing his friends, but they will most likely try to drag him back into things. His group would be the &quot;CYF&quot; or Crazy Young Fools, which would be a part of the Crips. He is stepping away from that part of his past, but still enjoys some of the things associated with it (Cars, Rap, etc.).<br /> <br /> As Daly City is part of the SF metro area, he would have most likely heard of the Sept through other Garou in the area. Seeing that, like himself, Mistwatch looks to need a new reputation, he would be attracted to it. Flamegift has it's own appeal, but the apathy the Gnawers have there is not appealing to his own Spiritual Journey.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1840-akashicmonk","name":"akashicmonk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1840_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-24T18:51:55-07:00","id":527232,"title":"","content":"Cool. Thunder Tiger can certainly be Freddy's mentor. You say Thunder Tiger found him after his First Change and wanted to teach Freddie inner peace. Did Freddy do anything he regrets when he underwent the First Change? Thrall of the Wyrm, that sort of thing. Also, is he the kind of person who lashes out, or who thinks about his actions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T12:06:48-07:00","id":527948,"title":"","content":"I see you have enough interested players already, but I'll try anyway. Who knows, maybe a spot will open up. Should chekc the forum more often...<br /> <br /> Shine Talon is a young lupus Silver Fang. He is descended from an unremarkable hero who bred among wolves when the Fangs first came in the territory; those packs have since been reclaimed as Red Talons kinfolk, though his white pelt mark him as unmistakably Fang even if many wolven generations removed from his lineage.<br /> The Homid-centric Fangs of this territory don't really know what to make of the young Ahroun. He doesn't show any interest in Sept politics or in dominating other &quot;lesser&quot; tribes. Any important heirloom or title his lineage could give him rights to have since long been claimed by other more prominent Fangs. On his part Shine Talon feels a little out of place in the tribe: they told him he is supposed to lead, but he can't understand who's supposed to follow and why.<br /> He has contacts among the Red Talons; he does small favors for them, like lending another set of fangs when the Wyrm intrudes in the wilderness or going into the cities for them when they would need to but would not be able. In return they sometimes reward him with small talens useful for a wolf, of which any other tribe is severely lacking. He has a distaste for their hatred and casual slaughter of humans, though he figures he doens't have to see eye to eye with them for them to work together.<br /> <br /> Feel free to ask more if you are interested, I won't take it as an invitation unless you explicitly tell me there's a spot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29-vidyaraja","name":"Vidyaraja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T12:12:41-07:00","id":527953,"title":"","content":"I also have a Wyrm-corrupted Camazotz Son of Osiris abomination wielding a magickal Wonder you might be more interested in!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29-vidyaraja","name":"Vidyaraja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T01:15:13-07:00","id":528635,"title":"","content":"Actually I still have a spot open, Bashir had already been recruited, so I didn't count him. NOW I've got two new interested players. So, Shine Talon. How would he feel about joining a pack? From what you've written, he seems like a beta wolf, who's more used to taking orders than giving them. Will he be comfortable in a leadership position? Also note, Bashir and akashicmonk want to play Ahrouns too, so there may be a bit of personality clashing there. How would Shine Talon deal with that?<br /> What would have drawn Shine Talon to San Francisco? All the characters will start off at Mistwatch Sept, which is about as urban a caern as you get. Is Shine Talon afraid? Or excited? Does he want to meet new people, or does he prefer being alone? Finanlly, you say Shine Talon dislikes the Red Talon's methods. Why does he continue to work with them? Does he have a Red Talon mentor, or some other personal connection to the tribe? <br /> <br /> And if Shine Talon doesn't work out, your second character option sounds great! The Children of Osiris never got enough airtime...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T04:40:55-07:00","id":528710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Al-Haleem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/519111-recruiting-mistwatch-werewolf-the-apocalypse?p=528635#post528635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> How would he feel about joining a pack? From what you've written, he seems like a beta wolf, who's more used to taking orders than giving them. Will he be comfortable in a leadership position?</div> </div> </div> </div>This would be kinda complicated for him. First, he's not so much a beta wolf as that he feels that dominance nad leadership beyond the pack level is a bit of a nonsense. Being a wolf he still recognizes the need for people who give orders and people who follow in an unit as small as a pack. And being an Ahroun when the going gets rough he'll probably take point, leading or not.<br /> However: the last time he challenged anyone for leadership was his brother in his native wolf pack. That's when he First Changed, which resulted in his brother being slaughtered and his pack scattered to the four winds. The Talons tell him that those wolves are so traumatized that every one of them has been living, ot dying, as a lone wolf. Despite the reassurances of the Garou this has marked him deeply. He could either make that guilt and the fear it could happen again his defining point or grow beyond that during the story, I don't really know.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Al-Haleem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/519111-recruiting-mistwatch-werewolf-the-apocalypse?p=528635#post528635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Also note, Bashir and akashicmonk want to play Ahrouns too, so there may be a bit of personality clashing there.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be perfect from the start. If anyone of them really pushed for pack leadership Shine Talon would probably let them decide and accept a position as second in command. He would probably not want to fall behind beta position though.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Al-Haleem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/519111-recruiting-mistwatch-werewolf-the-apocalypse?p=528635#post528635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> What would have drawn Shine Talon to San Francisco? All the characters will start off at Mistwatch Sept, which is about as urban a caern as you get. Is Shine Talon afraid? Or excited? Does he want to meet new people, or does he prefer being alone?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Fangs probably wouldn't want him anywhere near Mag Li. He's not really able to take part in Fangs-Fianna politics, and they feel like they couldn't completely trust him if they had to move against any other sept. On the other hand leaving him in the company of the Red Talons for an extended period of time would be unacceptable, what if he forms stronger bonds with a mongrel Tribe than with the Fangs? So they tell him to &quot;represent&quot; the Fangs at Mistwatch or something like that. If he proves his worthiness and loyalty to the Tribe there he can always be posted somewhere else later. Having no idea where to start with the whole Garou business he didn't really object.<br /> As a Lupus Shine Talon isn't too thrilled about spending a lot of time in the city. He fares better than most Lupus though, the Fangs taught him human language, behavior and etiquette. He likes meeting new Garou as he's an inquisitive fellow and meeting new people help him get a perspective on his own place and duties, though he probably wouldn't be able to articulate it like that. He doesn't really feel anything for humans one way or the other, though he understands that Homid have kin among the humans and they are to be respected and never harmed. As long as he can spend some time off-duty in his native woods he'll be fine.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Al-Haleem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/519111-recruiting-mistwatch-werewolf-the-apocalypse?p=528635#post528635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Finanlly, you say Shine Talon dislikes the Red Talon's methods. Why does he continue to work with them? Does he have a Red Talon mentor, or some other personal connection to the tribe?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Talons have a perspective about being a Lupus and a Garou that Shine Talon couldn't find among his own Tribe, immersed in human-think as it is. Plus they are the ones that found him wandering after he Firsted and they are closer to his home territory than any other. That's why he keeps working with them occasionally: he can't get what they are willing to give him anywhere else; plus it's nice to howl with Lupus from time to time.<br /> I wasn't thinking of purchasing a Red Talon mentor, more like some dots of contacts: not really friends, not really personal, just kind of people who give each other a social call and trade favors from time to time. Shine Talon used to have a Homid Ahroun mentor from his own Tribe, butthey parted ways as soon as he learned how to fight and how to live among humans.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29-vidyaraja","name":"Vidyaraja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T17:56:11-07:00","id":529462,"title":"","content":"Sorry for not responding quickly, been busy.<br /> <br /> Freddy's First Change happened when a rival gang jumped him. He ended up in Thrall to the Wyrm as he frenzied. Thunder Tiger found him shortly thereafter.<br /> <br /> His first reaction is to jump into things, but now, he is trying to think before acting. (&quot;Trying&quot; is the operative word there.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1840-akashicmonk","name":"akashicmonk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1840_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T18:58:39-07:00","id":529494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>akashicmonk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/519111-recruiting-mistwatch-werewolf-the-apocalypse?p=529462#post529462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for not responding quickly, been busy.<br /> <br /> Freddy's First Change happened when a rival gang jumped him. He ended up in Thrall to the Wyrm as he frenzied. Thunder Tiger found him shortly thereafter.<br /> <br /> His first reaction is to jump into things, but now, he is trying to think before acting. (&quot;Trying&quot; is the operative word there.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm...slaughtered members of a rival gang eh? I'm sure they're not pleased about that...And if Freddy succumbed to the Thrall of the Wyrm, he'll probably want to keep quiet about that. Garou aren't fans of corpse eaters. I am curious what Thunder Tiger sees in him though. <br /> <br /> Vidyraja: You look live you've put a lot of thought into your character. I like the idea of Shine Talon having a network of contacts. Just remember, someone may decide to collect on a favor in the the future...<br /> <br /> You both have fairly solid character concepts, so we might as well start getting a character sheet together. If you head over here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/519097-ooc-mistwatch-werewolf-the-apocalypse\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...the-apocalypse</a> You'll find the character sheet template we'll be using. As you fill it out, you'll probably start defining your characters better. The more complex they are, the more of them I can incorporate into the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T11:22:28-07:00","id":530141,"title":"","content":"Thanks for having me, Al-Haleem! I'll get to fill in that sheet soon... And yeah, contacts are there for that, to make life interesting<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">Are you really absolutely sure you don't want the Camazotz?</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29-vidyaraja","name":"Vidyaraja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-02T13:34:32-07:00","id":537394,"title":"","content":"And I wish I'd seen this sooner. I'm digging the setting you've got and would love to jump in if someone has to bow out. I've got a Silent Strider that I've been meaning to flesh out, so I could have you a character sheet in a day or two.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/nbylxup\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n18segp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0v25ewp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n77xu8p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1667-novagain","name":"Novagain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-02T19:58:42-07:00","id":537657,"title":"","content":"Hmmm...Well, there is one player I'm not 100% sure is coming back, so I'll hedge my bets. Welcome to the pack! I'll trust that your character isn't part Camazotz or something, and let you get on with character creation. If you haven't seen it, here's the OOC thread: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/519097-ooc-mistwatch-werewolf-the-apocalypse\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...the-apocalypse</a> You'll find the character sheet template we'll be using there, as well as a few house rules.<br /> <br /> PS: Unless someone else drops out, recruitment is now closed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-02T20:25:47-07:00","id":537680,"title":"","content":"Cool, I'll sit down with that later on tonight, and like I said, should have a character for you in a day or two (Working around work to get it done)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/nbylxup\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n18segp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0v25ewp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n77xu8p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1667-novagain","name":"Novagain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}